    "text": "from typing import List\n\ndef below_zero(operations: List[int]) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Handle deposit and withdrawal operations.\n    This function checks if the balance of the a bank account falls below zero at any\n    point.\n\n    Args::\n        operations (List[int]): A list of balance operations.\n\n    Returns:\n        bool: True if the balance falls below zero at any point, False.\n    \"\"\"\n    balance = 0\n    for operation in operations:\n        balance += operation\n        if balance < 0:\n            return True\n    return False\n\n# Example usage:\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    import doctest\n    doctest.testmod()",
